exports[`CLI help interface for 'settings update-check' should be expected english 1`] = `
"Usage: frodo settings update-check [options] [command]

Manage the automatic update check. Either the persisted setting or
FRODO_NO_UPDATE_CHECK can disable it.

Options:
  -h, --help        Help
  -hh, --help-more  Help with all options.
  -hhh, --help-all  Help with all options, environment variables, and usage
                    examples.

Runtime Options:
  --no-prompt       Never prompt interactively (same as setting
                    FRODO_NO_PROMPT).

Commands:
  disable           Persistently disable automatic update checks, without
                    setting FRODO_NO_UPDATE_CHECK in every shell.
  enable            Persistently enable automatic update checks.
                    FRODO_NO_UPDATE_CHECK can still disable them.
  show              Show whether automatic update checks are enabled and why.

Utilities:
  help              display help for command


Run without a sub-command to enter interactive mode."
`;
